To configure a Nokia router to enable receiving BGP Outbound Route Filtering (ORF) capabilities from a peer during extended community negotiation, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            accept-orf
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you need to apply this configuration to a specific BGP group or neighbor, use these variations:

For a BGP group:
```
