## User question:
"How to disable the capability of sending/receiving multiple paths per prefix in BGP on a Nokia router?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To disable the capability of sending/receiving multiple paths per prefix in BGP on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
no multipath
exit
```

If you want to specifically disable IBGP multipath as well, add:
```
configure router bgp
no ibgp-multipath
exit
