## User question:
Enable the best-external advertisement for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes on a Nokia router.
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable best-external advertisement for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    family label-ipv6
exit
```

This command enables the labeled-unicast IPv6 address family in the BGP configuration, allowing the router to advertise best-external routes for this family.
