To configure BGP on a Nokia router to aggregate bandwidth values from link-bandwidth extended communities for IPv4 routes received from EBGP peers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8 ebgp 8
    group <group-name>
        type external
        link-bandwidth
            accept-from-ebgp ipv4
        exit
        neighbor <neighbor-ip>
            peer-as <peer-as-number>
