Here are the CLI commands to configure BGP authentication with the encrypted key "K$12#mypass" using enhanced encryption:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <ip-address>
            authentication-key "K$12#mypass" hash2
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<ip-address>` with the neighbor's IP address. The `hash2` parameter provides enhanced encryption as requested.
