To enable BGP fast reroute for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family label-ipv6
                    resolution-filter
                        bgp
                        no shutdown
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enters the BGP configuration context
2. Configures next-hop resolution for labeled routes
3. Specifies transport tunnel settings for the label-ipv6 address family
4. Enables BGP as a resolution method under the resolution filter
5. Ensures the feature is not administratively shut down
