To enable BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of labeled IPv4 routes in a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family label-ipv4
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enters the context for configuring next-hop resolution options specifically for labeled-unicast IPv4 routes under BGP.
