Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure a Nokia router's BGP group with route reflector cluster ID 192.168.10.5 and ORR location 8 allowing local fallback:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        cluster 192.168.10.5 orr-location 8 allow-local-fallback
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your desired BGP group name. This configuration:
1. Creates a BGP group
2. Sets the route reflector cluster ID to 192.168.10.5
3. Configures ORR location 8 
4. Enables local fallback for the route reflector
