## User question:
"How to configure the BGP Connect Retry timer to 90 seconds on a Nokia router?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure the BGP Connect Retry timer to 90 seconds on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
connect-retry 90
exit
```

Alternatively, if you want to set it at the group or neighbor level:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
connect-retry 90
exit
```

or

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
connect-retry 90
exit
