To add a descriptive label "BGP_Group_A_Peering" to the current BGP group context on a Nokia router, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp group "BGP_Group_A_Peering"
``` 

This creates a BGP group with the specified name/label. You would then configure additional BGP parameters within this group context as needed.
