How to configure huawei router to accept a maximum of 500 dynamic BGP sessions from remote peers in the current BGP instance?
```json
{
    "commands": [
        "bgp [instance-id]",
        "peer [ipv4-address] as-number [as-number]",
        "maximum-peers 500"
    ]
}
```
原cli:
bgp [instance-id]
匹配的cli
bgp <as-number> instance <instance-name>
undo bgp <as-number> instance <instance-name>
