To configure a Nokia router to accept a maximum of 500 dynamic BGP sessions from remote peers in the current BGP instance, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        max-session 500
exit all
```

This command sets the maximum number of BGP sessions (both static and dynamic) that the router can establish to 500. Note that this is a global setting for the entire BGP instance.
