To configure BGP graceful restart with support for NOTIFICATION messages on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
        restart-time 300
    exit
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable BGP graceful restart globally
2. Configure support for NOTIFICATION messages during graceful restart
3. Set the restart timer to 300 seconds (default value)

The configuration will take effect when both peers support this capability.
