{'Parameters': 'ipv6', 'Info': 'Enables origin validation processing for unlabeled unicast IPv6 routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'label-ipv4', 'Info': 'Enables origin validation processing for labeled IPv4 routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'label-ipv6', 'Info': 'Enables origin validation processing for labeled IPv6 routes.'}
