This command ensures that all routes received from EBGP peers will be checked to confirm that the most recent ASN in their AS_PATH matches the configured `peer-as` value. If there's a mismatch, the session will be reset (or the route treated as withdrawn if update fault tolerance is enabled). 

The command can also be applied at the group or neighbor level if you need more granular control:

```
