How to enable updated BGP error handling procedures on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable updated BGP error handling procedures on a Nokia router, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp error-handling
```

This command applies at the global BGP level. If you need to enable it for a specific BGP group or neighbor, navigate to the respective context first:

For a BGP group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> error-handling
```

For a BGP neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> error-handling
