{
    "PageTitle": "ipv4-family vpnv4-multicast",
    "FuncDef": "The ipv4-family vpnv4-multicast command creates end enters the BGP-VPNv4-Multicast address family view.\nThe undo ipv4-family vpnv4-multicast command deletes the configurations in the BGP-VPNv4-Multicast address family.\nBy default, the BGP-IPv4 unicast address family view is displayed.",
    "CLIs": [
