Here are the CLI commands to configure long-lived graceful restart for the flow-ipv6 family:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        long-lived
            family flow-ipv6
        exit
    exit
exit
```

If you need to set specific timers or additional parameters for the long-lived graceful restart, you would add them under the `family flow-ipv6` context. The above configuration enables the basic long-lived graceful restart capability for the flow-ipv6 address family at the global BGP level.
