Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To configure next-hop-resolution options for VPN-IPv4 and VPN-IPv6 routes on a Nokia router when they are not imported into any VPRN service, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            allow-static
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables the resolution of BGP next-hops for VPN-IPv4 and VPN-IPv6 routes using static routes (excluding default static routes) when these routes are not imported into any VPRN service.
