```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunnels
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter
                        bgp
                        no shutdown
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enters the BGP next-hop resolution context
2. Configures shortcut tunnels for IPv6 family
3. Enables BGP as a resolution method for next-hop resolution
4. Ensures the feature is not shut down

The `family ipv6` context under `shortcut-tunnels` specifically handles unlabeled IPv6 routes, while the `bgp` command under `resolution-filter` enables BGP tunnels for next-hop resolution.
