To configure flowspec validations on a Nokia router, you need to enter the BGP configuration context and enable the flowspec address family. Here are the CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family flow-ipv4 flow-ipv6
```

To disable flowspec validations:
```
configure router bgp
    no family flow-ipv4 flow-ipv6
```
