To configure flowspec validations in Nokia router's BGP configuration, you need to enter the BGP context and enable the flowspec address family. Here are the CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family flow-ipv4 flow-ipv6
exit
```

This enters the BGP configuration context and enables both IPv4 and IPv6 flowspec address families. You can specify either `flow-ipv4` or `flow-ipv6` separately if you only need one of them.
