To enable BGP graceful restart helper functionality for IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
    family ipv6
exit
```

This configuration enables BGP graceful restart helper procedures globally for IPv6 routes. The `graceful-restart` command activates the helper functionality, while the `family ipv6` command ensures it applies specifically to IPv6 address family.
------------
