To enable load balancing for multiple IBGP paths with equal cost on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```bash
configure router bgp
    multipath 8 ibgp 8
    ibgp-multipath
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP multipath with a maximum of 8 paths (`multipath 8`)
2. Specifically allows up to 8 IBGP paths (`ibgp 8`)
3. Enables IBGP multipath load balancing (`ibgp-multipath`)

The values `8` can be adjusted based on your requirements (valid range is 1-64).
