To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv4 unicast prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes per prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    add-paths
        ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable BGP multipath with a maximum of 8 paths per prefix
2. Configure the add-paths capability for IPv4 unicast routes to:
   - Advertise up to 8 paths per prefix
   - Negotiate the ability to receive multiple routes per prefix
