## User question:
"How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv6 unicast prefix while disabling the receive capability?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv6 unicast prefix while disabling the receive capability, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family ipv6
    no family ipv6 receive
    multipath 8
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables the IPv6 address family under BGP
2. Disables the receive capability for IPv6
3. Sets the maximum number of multipaths to 8 for IPv6 prefixe
