To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv6 unicast prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes per prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    add-paths
        ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP multipath with a maximum of 8 paths per prefix (`multipath 8`)
2. Configures the add-paths capability for unlabeled IPv6 unicast routes to:
   - Advertise up to 8 paths per prefix (`ipv6 send 8`)
   - Negotiate to receive multiple routes per prefix (`receive`)
