To configure the BGP keepalive timer to 60 seconds on a Nokia router, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp keepalive 60
``` 

If you also need to adjust the hold-time (typically set to 3 times the keepalive), you can add:
```
configure router bgp hold-time 180
