To configure a route preference of 150 for labeled-unicast BGP routes on Nokia routers, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp label-preference 150
```

This command sets the route preference for labeled-unicast BGP routes to 150 at the global BGP level. You can also apply this at the group or neighbor level if needed:

For group level:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> label-preference 150
```

For neighbor level:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <neighbor-ip> label-preference 150
```
