To enter the context for configuring labeled route options in Nokia router's BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel
family label-ipv4
```

or 

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel
family label-ipv6
```

or 

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel
family vpn
```

Choose the appropriate `family` option based on whether you're configuring for labeled IPv4 (`label-ipv4`), labeled IPv6 (`label-ipv6`), or VPN routes (`vpn`).
