To enable LDP tunneling for next-hop resolution of BGP labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter ldp
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables LDP as the tunnel type for resolving BGP labeled IPv4 routes. The `resolution-filter ldp` command under the IPv4 family ensures that LDP tunnels are used for next-hop resolution.
