To configure a Nokia router to import leak-eligible routes from another routing instance's BGP RIB using the route policies "INTERNAL_POLICY_1" followed by "BACKUP_POLICY", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    import "INTERNAL_POLICY_1" "BACKUP_POLICY"
exit
```

This configuration applies the specified route policies in sequence to control the import of routes from another routing instance's BGP RIB. The first policy ("INTERNAL_POLICY_1") will be evaluated first, followed by the second policy ("BACKUP_POLICY") for any remaining routes.
------------
