To enable the import of link-state information into the BGP-LS address family on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family bgp-ls
    link-state-import-enable
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enter the BGP configuration context
2. Enable the BGP-LS address family
3. Enable the import of link-state information into BGP-LS
4. Exit the configuration context
