You are an expert assistant in configuring network devices. Based on the user's request and the retrieved content from the router configuration manual below, generate appropriate CLI configuration commands.

---

User Request:  
How to configure Nokia routers to use the IP address 192.0.2.1 as the source for BGP communication within a group?

Retrieved Reference Content (from the configuration manual):  
{
    "PageTitle": "neighbor",
    "FuncDef": "This command creates a BGP peer/neighbor instance within the context of the BGP group.",
    "CLIs": [
        "neighbor <ip-address>",
        "no neighbor <ip-address>"
    ],
    "ParentView": [
        "config>router>bgp>group"
    ],
    "ParaDef": [
