Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure Nokia routers for advertising up to 8 paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix and enabling reception of multiple multicast routes per prefix:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mcast-vpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enters the BGP configuration context
2. Configures add-paths for multicast IPv4 VPN routes
3. Sets the maximum advertised paths to 8 per prefix (`send 8`)
4. Enables receiving multiple routes per prefix (`receive`)
