You are an expert assistant in configuring network devices. Based on the user's request and the retrieved content from the router configuration manual below, generate appropriate CLI configuration commands.

---

User Request:  
Configure Nokia routers to advertise a maximum of 8 paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv4 VPN prefix.

Retrieved Reference Content (from the configuration manual):  
{
    "PageTitle": "multipath",
    "FuncDef": "This command enables BGP multipath for all address families that support ECMP forwarding.",
    "CLIs": [
        "multipath <max-paths> [ ebgp <ebgp-max-paths> ] [ ibgp <ibgp-max-paths> ] [ restrict { same-neighbor-as | exact-as-path } ]",
        "no multipath"
    ],
    "ParentView": [
        "config>router>bgp"
    ],
    "ParaDef": [
        {
            "Parameters": "max-paths",
            "Info": "Specifies the maximum number of multipaths per prefix/NLRI if ebgp-max-paths or ibgp-max-paths does not apply. Values-1 to 64."
        },
