Here are the CLI configuration commands to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and disable receiving multiple routes for this prefix:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8 restrict exact-as-path
    best-path-selection
        as-path-ignore mcast-ipv6
        ignore-router-id include-internal mvpn-ipv6
    exit
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable multipath with a maximum of 8 paths and restrict to exact AS path matches
2. Configure best path selection to ignore AS path length for multicast IPv6 routes
3. Ignore router ID comparisons for multicast VPN IPv6 routes to prevent route flapping
