Configure huawei router to allow up to 8 parallel paths per prefix with a restriction that non-best paths must share identical AS paths as the best path, while setting separate limits of 12 paths for EBGP and 16 paths for IBGP routes.
```json
{
    "commands": [
        "bgp maximum load-balancing 8",
        "bgp bestroute as-path-same-as bestpath",
        "bgp maximum load-balancing ebgp 12 ibgp 16"
    ]
}
```
