{'Parameters': 'receive', 'Info': 'Specifies that the router negotiates to receive multiple multicast VPN routes per IPv6 prefix.'}
{'Parameters': 'none', 'Info': 'Specifies that the router does not negotiate to receive multiple multicast VPN routes per IPv6 prefix.'}
