## User question:
How to enable inter-AS label security for VPN IPv6 family on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable inter-AS label security for VPN IPv6 family on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
    family vpn-ipv6
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables inter-AS VPN functionality at the BGP level
2. Adds support for the VPN IPv6 address family

For additional security, you may want to consider adding these complementary commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enforce-first-as
    no third-party-nexthop
exit
