Here are the CLI commands to configure a BGP peer with IP address 192.0.2.1 on a Nokia router:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor 192.0.2.1
            peer-as <remote-as-number>
            no shutdown
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<remote-as-number>` with the autonomous system number of the remote peer.
