To configure Nokia routers to treat all BGP routes with Invalid origin validation state as unusable in best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        origin-invalid-unusable
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration ensures that routes with an Invalid origin validation state are excluded from best path selection and not used for forwarding or advertisement to BGP peers.
