## User question:
How to configure Nokia routers to treat all BGP routes with Invalid origin validation state as unusable for best path selection?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to treat all BGP routes with Invalid origin validation state as unusable for best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        enable-origin-validation ipv4 ipv6
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables origin validation for both IPv4 and IPv6 routes at the BGP group level. Routes with an Invalid origin validation state will automatically be excluded from best path selection.
---
