How to configure huawei routers to enable BGP prefix-based filtering capability for exchanging routes with peers?
```json
{
    "commands": [
        "ip ip-prefix PREFIX_NAME index 10 permit 192.168.0.0 16",
        "bgp 100",
        "peer 10.0.0.1 ip-prefix PREFIX_NAME import"
    ]
}
```
