To set the route preference to 200 for BGP-learned routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp preference 200
```

This command sets the route preference for all BGP-learned routes to 200. The configuration can be applied at the global BGP level (`config>router>bgp`), BGP group level (`config>router>bgp>group`), or neighbor level (`config>router>bgp>group>neighbor`) depending on your specific requirements.
