To configure the primary IPv4 address 192.168.10.1 for BGP optimal route reflection on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    cluster 192.168.10.1 orr-location 1
exit
```

This sets the route reflector cluster ID to 192.168.10.1 and assigns it to ORR location 1 for optimal route reflection.
