To configure the Nokia router to wait 15 minutes before removing stale VPN-IP routes from RIB-IN after sending a Route-Refresh, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp purge-timer 15
``` 

This sets the purge timer to 15 minutes (900 seconds). The router will maintain stale VPN-IP routes for this duration before purging them if they aren't refreshed.
