---
## User question:
How to configure Nokia routers to automatically remove stale BGP VPN-IP routes after 15 minutes if they are not refreshed?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to automatically remove stale BGP VPN-IP routes after 15 minutes if they are not refreshed, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp purge-timer 15
```

This command sets the purge timer to 15 minutes, after which any stale VPN-IP routes that haven't been refreshed will be automatically removed.
