## Proposed answer:
To enable BGP rapid update for the MVPN-IPv6 address family on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family mvpn-ipv6
exit
```

If you need to configure this for a specific BGP group or neighbor, the commands would be:

For a group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    family mvpn-ipv6
exit
```

For a neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    family mvpn-ipv6
exit
