## User question:
How to disable the delay in sending BGP withdrawals on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To disable the delay in sending BGP withdrawals on a Nokia router, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart no long-lived
```

This command disables the long-lived graceful restart feature, which can cause delays in BGP withdrawal propagation. Apply this at the global BGP level, or optionally at the group or neighbor level if needed.
---
