Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To enable reporting of local routes to the BMP monitoring station on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station <station-name>
            report-local-routes
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `<station-name>` with the name of your BMP monitoring station. This command will enable the router to send local route information to the specified BMP station.
