## Proposed answer:
To enable reporting of local routes to the BMP monitoring station on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station <station-name>
            report-local-routes
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `<station-name>` with the name of your BMP monitoring station. This command will enable the router to send local route information to the specified BMP station.
