## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
resolution { any | filter | disabled }
FuncDef:
This command configures the resolution mode in the resolution of BGP label routes using tunnels to BGP peers.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'any', 'Info': 'Enables the binding to any supported tunnel type in the BGP label route context following TTM preference.'}
{'Parameters': 'filter', 'Info': 'Enables the binding to the subset of tunnel types configured under resolution-filter.'}
{'Parameters': 'disabled', 'Info': 'Disables the resolution of BGP label routes using tunnels to BGP peers.'}
