This command configures the resolution mode in the resolution of BGP prefixes using tunnels to BGP peers.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'any', 'Info': 'Enables the binding to any supported tunnel type in BGP shortcut context following TTM preference.'}
{'Parameters': 'filter', 'Info': 'Enables the binding to the subset of tunnel types configured under resolution-filter.'}
{'Parameters': 'disabled', 'Info': 'Disables the resolution of BGP prefixes using tunnels to BGP peers.'}
