## User question:
"How to configure Nokia router's BGP next-hop resolution to only bind to tunnel types specified in the resolution-filter?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure BGP next-hop resolution to only bind to specific tunnel types in the resolution-filter, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family [label-ipv4|label-ipv6|vpn]
                    resolution-filter
                        [bgp|ldp|rsvp|sr-te|none]
```

For example, to allow only BGP tunnels for labeled IPv4 routes:
```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family label-ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        bgp
```

Or for multiple tunnel types (e.g., RSVP and SR-TE):
```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family label-ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        rsvp
                        sr-te
---
