To configure a Nokia router to advertise BGP graceful restart capability with a restart-time of 600 seconds, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 600
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables BGP graceful restart at the global BGP level and sets the advertised restart-time to 600 seconds.
