Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To enable tunnels programmed via RibApi gRPC service for resolving next hops of label-IPv4 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family label-ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        bgp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of label-IPv4 routes, allowing the use of tunnels programmed via RibApi gRPC service.
