---
## Proposed answer:
To enable sending both pre-policy and post-policy BGP route monitoring messages on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    monitor
        no shutdown
        pre-policy
        post-policy
    exit
exit
```

These commands configure BGP monitoring with both pre-policy and post-policy message generation enabled.
