## Proposed answer:
To enable sending both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring messages on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp monitor
    route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
exit
```

This configuration will enable BMP to send both types of route monitoring messages. The command can be applied at different hierarchy levels depending on your specific needs (global BGP, group level, or neighbor level).
