To configure the Nokia router to import active IPv4 routes from the IP route table into BGP RIB using a policy named "customer-routes", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        rib-management
            ipv4
                route-table-import "customer-routes"
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration applies the "customer-routes" policy to control which active IPv4 routes from the IP route table are imported into the BGP RIB.
