## Proposed answer:
To configure the Nokia router to negotiate BGP ORF send capability for the extended community target:192.0.2.10:65535, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            send-orf target:192.0.2.10:65535
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you need to apply this to a specific BGP group or neighbor, use the appropriate context:

For a group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            send-orf target:192.0.2.10:65535
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

For a neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            send-orf target:192.0.2.10:65535
            exit
        exit
    exit
