To configure Nokia routers for resolving unlabeled IPv4 BGP routes using tunnel types under BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnel
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter bgp
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enters the BGP configuration context
2. Configures next-hop resolution for unlabeled IPv4 routes
3. Specifies BGP tunnels as the resolution method for these routes

The `resolution-filter bgp` command enables the use of BGP tunnels (specifically label-unicast IPv4 routes for /32 prefixes) for resolving the next-hops of unlabeled IPv4 BGP routes.
