## User question:
How to configure Nokia routers to maintain stale BGP routes for 300 seconds during graceful restart?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to maintain stale BGP routes for 300 seconds during graceful restart, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 300
    exit
exit
```

This configuration sets the BGP graceful restart timer to 300 seconds globally for all peers. The `graceful-restart` command enables the helper functionality, and `restart-time 300` specifies the duration to keep stale routes before purging them.
