no stale-routes-time
FuncDef:
This command configures the maximum amount of time in seconds that stale routes should be maintained after a graceful restart is initiated.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'time', 'Info': 'Specifies the amount of time that stale routes should be maintained after a graceful restart is initiated. Values-1 to 3600 seconds.'}
