Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure the remote BMP monitoring station:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP_MONITOR" create
            connection
                station-address 192.0.2.10 port 5000
                exit
            family ipv4
            no shutdown
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you also want to enable route monitoring (both pre-policy and post-policy), add these additional commands under the BGP configuration context where needed (router/group/neighbor level):

```
configure
    router bgp
        monitor
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
            exit
        exit
    exit
```
