To configure a BMP monitoring station named "NYC-DC1" on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "NYC-DC1"
            no shutdown
        exit
    exit
```

This creates a BMP monitoring station named "NYC-DC1" and ensures it is enabled (not shut down). You may need to add additional configuration under the station context depending on your specific requirements for connection parameters, monitoring policies, or other settings.
