To configure a BMP monitoring station named "NYC-DC1" on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "NYC-DC1"
            no shutdown
        exit
    exit
```

This creates a BMP monitoring station named "NYC-DC1" and ensures it is enabled (not shut down). You can then add specific monitoring configurations under this station as needed.
