Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To configure your Nokia router to send BMP messages to the monitoring stations "NYC-DC1" and "LON-DC2", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "NYC-DC1"
            connection
                router <router-instance>
            exit
            report-local-routes
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
        exit
        station "LON-DC2"
            connection
                router <router-instance>
            exit
            report-local-routes
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<router-instance>` with the appropriate router instance or VPRN service ID for each monitoring station connection. This configuration enables both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring messages to be sent to both stations, along with local route reporting.
