Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure your Nokia router to send BMP messages to monitoring stations "NYC-DC1" and "LAX-DC2" under BGP monitor context:

```
configure router bgp
    monitor
        station "NYC-DC1"
            no shutdown
        exit
        station "LAX-DC2"
            no shutdown
        exit
    exit
exit
```

To enable both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring (if desired), add these commands under each station:

```
configure router bgp
    monitor
        station "NYC-DC1"
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
        exit
        station "LAX-DC2"
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
        exit
    exit
exit
```
