To configure the Nokia router to send statistics reporting messages to the BMP monitoring station every 60 seconds, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP_STATION_NAME"
            connection
                router "BASE_ROUTER_INSTANCE"
            exit
            report-local-routes
            min-route-advertisement 60
            route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `BMP_STATION_NAME` with the name of your BMP monitoring station and `BASE_ROUTER_INSTANCE` with the appropriate router instance (e.g., "Base"). This configuration sets the reporting interval to 60 seconds, enables local route reporting, and configures both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring.
------------
