## Proposed answer:
To enter the configuration context for setting tunnel resolution options for BGP labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
bgp
next-hop-resolution
labeled-routes
transport-tunnel
family
resolution-filter
```

From this context, you can then specify the tunnel types to be used for resolution (e.g., `bgp`, `ldp`, `rsvp`, etc.) as needed.
