{
    "PageTitle": "bgp",
    "FuncDef": "The bgp command enables BGP and enter the BGP view or displays the BGP view directly.\nThe undo bgp command disables BGP.\nBy default, the BGP is disabled.",
    "CLIs": [
        "bgp <as-number>",
