```

This configuration enables the resolution of BGP next-hops for labeled routes (label-IPv4 and label-IPv6) using static routes, which includes UDP transport tunnels if they are configured as static routes. The `allow-static` command must be enabled under the `labeled-routes` context within BGP next-hop resolution.
