## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to enable recursive resolution of BGP next-hops for unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 routes using BGP routes?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure recursive resolution of BGP next-hops for unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 routes using BGP routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        use-bgp-routes
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables the router to use BGP routes for resolving next-hops of unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 routes, supporting up to four levels of recursion. The setting applies globally to all BGP routes in the base routing instance.
