## Proposed answer:
To enable BGP route recursion for resolving next-hops of unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        use-bgp-routes
    exit
exit
