To enable validation of received BGP flowspec routes containing destination prefixes on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `validate-redirect-ip` command under the BGP flowspec context. Here's the CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp flowspec
    validate-redirect-ip
exit
```

This command ensures that the `redirect-to-IPv4` action attached to flowspec IPv4 routes is validated before being accepted.
------------
