How to configure a Nokia router to apply BGP import route policies from the base instance to VPN-IPv4 and EVPN routes?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to apply BGP import route policies from the base instance to VPN-IPv4 and EVPN routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    vpn-apply-import
exit
```

This command enables the application of base instance BGP import route policies to VPN-IPv4, VPN-IPv6, and EVPN routes. The setting can be applied at the global BGP level, group level, or neighbor level depending on your specific requirements.
