To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 VPN-IPv6 paths per NLRI while disabling the add-paths receive capability, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    add-paths
        vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
``` 

This configuration:
1. Sets the maximum multipaths per prefix/NLRI to 8
2. Configures the router to advertise up to 8 VPN-IPv6 paths per NLRI 
3. Disables the add-paths receive capability for VPN-IPv6 routes
